        "reasons": {
            "correctness": "Entity column, DTO field, paged mapping and both controller builders carry displayOrder; toDto gets it through ModelMapper. Hidden tests 4/4. But the seed gives PLN 0 and all unlisted currencies default 0, so PLN is not guaranteed first.",
